  "data_leakage_note": "PageValues has an extraordinarily high correlation with Revenue (~0.49). In e-commerce analytics, PageValues reflects the average value of a web page visited by the user prior to completing an e-commerce transaction. Including PageValues creates post-hoc target leakage for real-time pre-purchase prediction when a visitor is actively browsing. Hence, PageValues is excluded from the real-time operational classification model."
